' Acting through a selected camper (`preset classic ai none seed 3 start 30
' party`: a companion handed over, a prepared state; the mercenary, record
' 106, hired as in v12_dismiss_question and left camped at Paradise Camp,
' then selected by a click on him). v1.2 acts through `SelectedCharacter`
' whoever he is (LocationScene.cs:222-275, 1224-1245, 1309-1386):
'  - the tent's door: he walks to it and the room opens on him, his page
'    alone (`SetScene("InventoryScene", SelectedCharacter)`);
'  - the technician (61): he walks over and the conversation opens with him
'    as the boss, so with TALK and EXIT only (`boss.IsPlayerCharacter` is
'    false, Dialog.cs:115-122);
'  - in fight mode the dog that came for him (307): an encounter with him alone as the
'    attacker (`TryAttack`: `new[] { attacker }`): "the mercenary hits the
'    dog" and the dog's answer to him, nobody else.
' Before, each logged "through a camper: … not in this port yet".
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 110,122         ' into Paradise Camp
wait 60
mapclick 72,152          ' the snake lying here
wait 150
uiclick 266,118
wait 10
esc
wait 10
clickon 106              ' the mercenary: the talk opens
wait 30
press down
press down               ' "Would you like to work for me?"
press space
wait 3
press space              ' the first answer lit
press down               ' "OK, you'll get snake"
press space              ' hired
wait 20
join                     ' he stays: Paradise Camp is ours
wait 10
clickon 106              ' the camper, selected
wait 5
fight                    ' fight mode
wait 200                 ' a dog comes for him
clickon 307              ' the dog: he alone attacks
wait 30
snap camper_fight
wait 200
fight                    ' speak mode
wait 5
mapclick 177,150         ' the tent: he walks there and goes in
wait 300
snap camper_room
esc
wait 10
clickon 61               ' the technician: he walks over and talks
wait 400
snap camper_talk
talkline 0               ' "( continue... )"
wait 3
talkline 0
wait 3
snap camper_answers      ' TALK and EXIT only
talkline 2               ' EXIT
wait 10
save
quit
